      "content": "therapist isn't really the point. it's just that it feels so inevitable. like once the lights go out, there's nothing left to save. why keep trying to fix a house that's basically empty anyway? it honestly feels more peaceful to just let it happen. to just let the dark come in instead of fighting it.",
